<title>THAILAND: Tipco Asphalt yr net profit up.</title>
<headline>Tipco Asphalt yr net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for</p>
<p>year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					  Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		  6.18     vs	    5.43</p>
<p>    Net			 648.51     vs	  425.61</p>
<p>NOTES: Revs not stated. Company's full name is Tipco Asphalt</p>
